search?q=uuid:eb3a4744-26e4-404a-be65-c72bb17f5cfc\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>Stats</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">MAG_Druid_Spore_Magic_Leather_Armor</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:MAG_Druid_Spore_Magic_Leather_Armor+type:stat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:MAG_Druid_Spore_Magic_Leather_Armor+type:stat\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>File</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">ARM_Druid_A_Body_Leaves</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span>    <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>File</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">ARM_Druid_B_2_Pants</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span>    <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>File</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">ARM_Druid_C_2_Body</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span>    <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>File</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">ARM_Druid_C_2_Sleeve</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"></span></li></ul>\n</div> \n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Special\">Special</span></h3>\n<p>The wearer of this item gains:\n\n</p>\n<dl><dt><a href=\"/wiki/Malefic_Funghi\" title=\"Malefic Funghi\">Malefic Funghi</a></dt><dd>The wearer gains a +1 bonus to <a href=\"/wiki/Spell_Save_DC\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Spell Save DC\">Spell Save DC</a> and when dealing <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Necrotic\" title=\"Necrotic\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Necrotic\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Necrotic\" title=\"Necrotic\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-necrotic\">Necrotic</span></a> damage, they deal an additional <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-necrotic\">1</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Necrotic\" title=\"Necrotic\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Necrotic\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Necrotic\" title=\"Necrotic\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-necrotic\">Necrotic</span></a> damage.</dd></dl><dl><dt><a href=\"/wiki/Spore_Sacks\" title=\"Spore Sacks\">Spore Sacks</a></dt><dd>While imbued with <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Symbiotic_Entity_(Condition)\" title=\"Symbiotic Entity (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/63/Symbiotic_Entity_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Symbiotic_Entity_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/63/Symbiotic_Entity_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Symbiotic_Entity_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/63/Symbiotic_Entity_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Symbiotic_Entity_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Symbiotic Entity\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/63/Symbiotic_Entity_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Symbiotic_Entity_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/63/Symbiotic_Entity_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Symbiotic_Entity_(Condition)\" title=\"Symbiotic Entity (Condition)\">Symbiotic Entity</a>, you can spread <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bibberbang_Spores\" title=\"Bibberbang Spores\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8a/Bibberbang_Spores_Icon.webp/25px-Bibberbang_Spores_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8a/Bibberbang_Spores_Icon.webp/38px-Bibberbang_Spores_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8a/Bibberbang_Spores_Icon.webp/50px-Bibberbang_Spores_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bibberbang Spores\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8a/Bibberbang_Spores_Icon.webp/25px-Bibberbang_Spores_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8a/Bibberbang_Spores_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Bibberbang_Spores\" title=\"Bibberbang Spores\">Bibberbang Spores</a>, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Timmask_Spores_(class_action)\" title=\"Timmask Spores (class action)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c8/Timmask_Spores_class_action_Icon.webp/25px-Timmask_Spores_class_action_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c8/Timmask_Spores_class_action_Icon.webp/38px-Timmask_Spores_class_action_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c8/Timmask_Spores_class_action_Icon.webp/50px-Timmask_Spores_class_action_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Timmask Spores\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c8/Timmask_Spores_class_action_Icon.webp/25px-Timmask_Spores_class_action_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c8/Timmask_Spores_class_action_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Timmask_Spores_(class_action)\" title=\"Timmask Spores (class action)\">Timmask Spores</a>, and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Haste_Spores\" title=\"Haste Spores\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3b/Haste_Spores_Icon.webp/25px-Haste_Spores_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3b/Haste_Spores_Icon.webp/38px-Haste_Spores_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3b/Haste_Spores_Icon.webp/50px-Haste_Spores_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Haste Spores\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3b/Haste_Spores_Icon.webp/25px-Haste_Spores_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3b/Haste_Spores_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Haste_Spores\" title=\"Haste Spores\">Haste Spores</a>.</dd></dl>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>    \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Philgrave%27s_Mansion\" title=\"Philgrave's Mansion\">Philgrave's Mansion</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;14&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-160</span>: Sold by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mystic_Carrion\" title=\"Mystic Carrion\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Portrait_Mystic_Carrion.png/25px-Portrait_Mystic_Carrion.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fe/Portrait_Mystic_Carrion.png/38px-Portrait_Mystic_Carrion.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fe/Portrait_Mystic_Carrion.png/50px-Portrait_Mystic_Carrion.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Mystic Carrion\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Portrait_Mystic_Carrion.png/25px-Portrait_Mystic_Carrion.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fe/Portrait_Mystic_Carrion.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Mystic_Carrion\" title=\"Mystic Carrion\">Mystic Carrion</a></li></ul>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>This armour is largely intended for a <a href=\"/wiki/Circle_of_Spores\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Circle of Spores\">Circle of Spores</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Druid\" title=\"Druid\">Druid</a>. It is one of three light armours designed for specific Druid subclasses, the others being <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-very-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Armour_of_Landfall\" title=\"Armour of Landfall\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b3/Armour_of_Landfall_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Armour_of_Landfall_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b3/Armour_of_Landfall_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Armour_of_Landfall_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b3/Armour_of_Landfall_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Armour_of_Landfall_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b3/Armour_of_Landfall_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Armour_of_Landfall_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b3/Armour_of_Landfall_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Armour_of_Landfall\" title=\"Armour of Landfall\">Armour of Landfall</a> for <a href=\"/wiki/Circle_of_the_Land\" title=\"Circle of the Land\">Circle of the Land</a> and <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-very-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Armour_of_Moonbasking\" title=\"Armour of Moonbasking\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b3/Armour_of_Landfall_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Armour_of_Landfall_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b3/Armour_of_Landfall_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Armour_of_Landfall_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b3/Armour_of_Landfall_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Armour_of_Landfall_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b3/Armour_of_Landfall_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Armour_of_Landfall_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b3/Armour_of_Landfall_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Armour_of_Moonbasking\" title=\"Armour of Moonbasking\">Armour of Moonbasking</a> for <a href=\"/wiki/Circle_of_the_Moon\" title=\"Circle of the Moon\">Circle of the Moon</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Circle_of_the_Stars\" title=\"Circle of the Stars\">Circle of the Stars</a>.</li></ul>\n\n<p><i>Regarding Malefic Funghi:</i></p>\n<ul><li>Since elemental damage from several sources is additive in one instance, <b>Malefic Funghi</b> only provides 1 extra damage regardless of the number of sources of necrotic damage. For example, a <a href=\"/wiki/Vampire_Ascendant\" title=\"Vampire Ascendant\">Vampire Ascendant</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Astarion\" title=\"Astarion\">Astarion</a> with <a href=\"/wiki/Manifestation_of_Body\" title=\"Manifestation of Body\">Manifestation of Body</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Symbiotic_Entity\" title=\"Symbiotic Entity\">Symbiotic Entity</a> active deals only 1 extra necrotic damage with this armour equipped, despite having three separate sources of necrotic damage.</li></ul>\n</div>  \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-packed\">\n\t<li class=\"gallerycaption\">Appearance in game</li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 128px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 126px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Armour_of_the_Sporekeeper_(Astarion).jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/93/Armour_of_the_Sporekeeper_%28Astarion%29.jpg/189px-Armour_of_the_Sporekeeper_%28Astarion%29.jpg.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/93/Armour_of_the_Sporekeeper_%28Astarion%29.jpg/283px-Armour_of_the_Sporekeeper_%28Astarion%29.jpg.webp 1.5x, /w/images/9/93/Armour_of_the_Sporekeeper_%28Astarion%29.jpg 2x\"><img alt=\"Armour of the Sporekeeper worn by Astarion\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/93/Armour_of_the_Sporekeeper_%28Astarion%29.jpg/189px-Armour_of_the_Sporekeeper_%28Astarion%29.jpg.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"126\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/93/Armour_of_the_Sporekeeper_%28Astarion%29.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\"></div>\n\t\t</li>\n</ul>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-packed\">\n\t<li class=\"gallerycaption\">Models</li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 100px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 98px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Armour_of_the_Sporekeeper_Human_Front_Model.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"Body Type 1 Front Human\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4a/Armour_of_the_Sporekeeper_Human_Front_Model.webp/147px-Armour_of_the_Sporekeeper_Human_Front_Model.webp, /w/images/4/4a/Armour_of_the_Sporekeeper_Human_Fron